{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "stm-1258-ajuste-facturacion-nc",
		"name": "STM-1258 - Ajuste Facturacion NC",
		"description": "Ajuste al servicio de facturacion y nota de credito para visualizar y actualizar datos en el front\n\nBFF: https://dev.fbusinesscenter.com/ppsomx/fiscal\nAPI Backend: fiscal-api (Puerto 8082)",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Visualizacion",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Buscar Facturas",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"rfcEmisor\": \"{{rfc_emisor}}\",\n  \"fechaInicioRecepcion\": \"2025-01-01\",\n  \"fechaFinalRecepcion\": \"2025-12-31\",\n  \"tipoDocumento\": \"I\",\n  \"page\": 0,\n  \"size\": 20\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{bff_fiscal_url}}/invoices/search",
							"host": ["{{bff_fiscal_url}}"],
							"path": ["invoices", "search"]
						},
						"description": "Busqueda de facturas (tipoDocumento=I)\n\nFiltros obligatorios:\n- rfcEmisor: RFC del emisor/proveedor\n- fechaInicioRecepcion: Fecha inicio (YYYY-MM-DD)\n- fechaFinalRecepcion: Fecha fin (YYYY-MM-DD)\n- tipoDocumento: I (Factura)\n\nFiltros opcionales:\n- rfcReceptor: RFC del receptor\n- idProveedor: Numero de proveedor\n- serie: Serie del documento\n- folio: Folio del documento\n- uuid: UUID fiscal\n- estatus: Codigo de estatus"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Buscar Notas de Credito",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"rfcEmisor\": \"{{rfc_emisor}}\",\n  \"fechaInicioRecepcion\": \"2025-01-01\",\n  \"fechaFinalRecepcion\": \"2025-12-31\",\n  \"tipoDocumento\": \"E\",\n  \"page\": 0,\n  \"size\": 20\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{bff_fiscal_url}}/invoices/search",
							"host": ["{{bff_fiscal_url}}"],
							"path": ["invoices", "search"]
						},
						"description": "Busqueda de Notas de Credito (tipoDocumento=E)\n\nLa respuesta incluye:\n- Datos del comprobante\n- Datos del emisor\n- Datos del receptor\n- Datos de addenda\n- XML completo\n- Factura relacionada (para NC)"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Buscar por UUID Fiscal",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"rfcEmisor\": \"{{rfc_emisor}}\",\n  \"fechaInicioRecepcion\": \"2025-01-01\",\n  \"fechaFinalRecepcion\": \"2025-12-31\",\n  \"tipoDocumento\": \"I\",\n  \"uuid\": \"{{fiscal_uuid}}\",\n  \"page\": 0,\n  \"size\": 20\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{bff_fiscal_url}}/invoices/search",
							"host": ["{{bff_fiscal_url}}"],
							"path": ["invoices", "search"]
						},
						"description": "Busqueda especifica por UUID fiscal del SAT"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Buscar por Proveedor",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"rfcEmisor\": \"{{rfc_emisor}}\",\n  \"fechaInicioRecepcion\": \"2025-01-01\",\n  \"fechaFinalRecepcion\": \"2025-12-31\",\n  \"tipoDocumento\": \"I\",\n  \"idProveedor\": {{id_proveedor}},\n  \"page\": 0,\n  \"size\": 20\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{bff_fiscal_url}}/invoices/search",
							"host": ["{{bff_fiscal_url}}"],
							"path": ["invoices", "search"]
						},
						"description": "Busqueda por numero de proveedor (Supplier Number)"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "Actualizacion",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Actualizar Factura",
					"request": {
						"method": "PUT",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"uuid\": \"{{fiscal_uuid}}\",\n  \"numeroProveedor\": {{id_proveedor}},\n  \"estatus\": 2,\n  \"idUsuarioActualizacion\": 12345,\n  \"addenda\": {\n    \"noOc\": \"OC-12345\",\n    \"noRecepcion\": \"REC-001\"\n  }\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{bff_fiscal_url}}/invoices",
							"host": ["{{bff_fiscal_url}}"],
							"path": ["invoices"]
						},
						"description": "Actualizar factura - estatus y/o datos de addenda\n\nCampos obligatorios:\n- uuid: UUID fiscal del documento (del SAT)\n- numeroProveedor: Supplier Number\n- estatus: Nuevo codigo de estatus\n- idUsuarioActualizacion: ID del usuario\n\nCodigos de estatus para Facturas:\n- 0: Rechazo Comercial\n- 1: Pendiente Addenda\n- 2: Recibido Parcial\n- 3: Pendiente Contabilizar\n- 4: Proceso Descarga\n- 5: Desglose Factura\n- 6: Pendiente Envio\n- 7: Aplicado\n- 8: Completado\n- 11: Rechazo Contable\n- 12: No valido fiscal\n- 13: Cerrado"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Actualizar Nota de Credito",
					"request": {
						"method": "PUT",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"uuid\": \"{{fiscal_uuid_nc}}\",\n  \"numeroProveedor\": {{id_proveedor}},\n  \"estatus\": 2,\n  \"idUsuarioActualizacion\": 12345,\n  \"addenda\": {\n    \"tipoNotaCredito\": \"01\"\n  }\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{bff_fiscal_url}}/invoices",
							"host": ["{{bff_fiscal_url}}"],
							"path": ["invoices"]
						},
						"description": "Actualizar nota de credito - estatus y/o datos de addenda\n\nCodigos de estatus para Notas de Credito:\n- 0: Rechazo Comercial\n- 1: Pendiente Addenda\n- 2: Recibido Parcial\n- 3: Pendiente Contabilizar\n- 4: Proceso Descarga\n- 5: Desglose NC\n- 6: Pendiente Envio\n- 7: Aplicado\n- 8: Completado\n- 11: Rechazo Contable\n- 12: No valido fiscal"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Cambiar Solo Estatus",
					"request": {
						"method": "PUT",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"uuid\": \"{{fiscal_uuid}}\",\n  \"numeroProveedor\": {{id_proveedor}},\n  \"estatus\": 3,\n  \"idUsuarioActualizacion\": 12345\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{bff_fiscal_url}}/invoices",
							"host": ["{{bff_fiscal_url}}"],
							"path": ["invoices"]
						},
						"description": "Actualizar solo el estatus sin modificar addenda"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		}
	],
	"event": [
		{
			"listen": "prerequest",
			"script": {
				"type": "text/javascript",
				"exec": [""]
			}
		},
		{
			"listen": "test",
			"script": {
				"type": "text/javascript",
				"exec": [""]
			}
		}
	],
	"variable": [
		{"key": "bff_fiscal_url", "value": "https://dev.fbusinesscenter.com/ppsomx/fiscal", "type": "string"},
		{"key": "rfc_emisor", "value": "SOD970101ABC", "type": "string"},
		{"key": "id_proveedor", "value": "12345", "type": "string"},
		{"key": "fiscal_uuid", "value": "aaaaaaaa-1111-2222-3333-444444444444", "type": "string"},
		{"key": "fiscal_uuid_nc", "value": "bbbbbbbb-1111-2222-3333-444444444444", "type": "string"}
	]
}
